Subject: [PATCH] dropbear: backport current 24.10 security fixes to 2025.89

Retain the newer local Dropbear release and authorized_keys path helper.
Port the stable branch privilege, scp, listener and pubkey option fixes
without reverting the release-specific endian checks and SK build guards.

